### BASE
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api

### 1) REGISTER
POST {{baseUrl}}/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "first_name": "Nassim",
  "last_name": "Touati",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "strongpassword123",
  "client_number": "AT12345",
  "fix_phone_number": "031123456",
  "phone_number": "0550123456",
  "address": "Constantine",
  "service_type": "ADSL",
  "user_type": "SIMPLE"
}

### 2) GET JWT TOKENS
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/token/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "strongpassword123"
}

### Paste the access token here after you get it
